> <span class="vy-vy-icon vy-vy-icon-new vy-vy-icon-close"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2.66 1.34 2 .68.68 2l.66.66 1.32-1.32zm18.68 21.32.66.66L23.32 22l-.66-.66-1.32 1.32zm1.32-20 .66-.66L22 .68l-.66.66 1.32 1.32zM1.34 21.34.68 22 2 23.32l.66-.66-1.32-1.32zm0-18.68 10 10 1.32-1.32-10-10-1.32 1.32zm11.32 10 10-10-1.32-1.32-10 10 1.32 1.32zm-1.32-1.32-10 10 1.32 1.32 10-10-1.32-1.32zm0 1.32 10 10 1.32-1.32-10-10-1.32 1.32z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> </span> </span> </span> </button> </div> <div class="vy-vy-quick-cart__empty-state"> <h3 class="vy-vy-quick-cart__empty-state-heading"> Your cart is empty </h3> <div class="vy-vy-button-block__button vy-vy-button-block__button--justify-center vy-vy-button-block__button--justify-mobile-center vy-vy-quick-cart__empty-state-promo-button"><a href="/collections" class="vy-vy-btn vy-vy-btn--secondary"> <span>Continue shopping</span> </a> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div><section id="shopify-section-sections--25783709696315__pdp_reasons_xkVGQE" class="vy-vy-shopify-section vy-vy-shopify-section-group-overlay-group vy-vy-pdp-reasons-section" style="display: none !important;"> <section class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons" id="pdp-reasons"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__stars-bar"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__stars"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"></path></svg> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"></path></svg> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"></path></svg> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"></path></svg> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"></path></svg> </div> <span class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__stars-score">4.9</span> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__stars-divider"></div> <span class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__stars-label">Loved by 18,000+ families</span> </div> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__intro"> <h2 class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__intro-heading">4 Reasons Parents Say This Book Finally Got Their Kid Off The Screen</h2> <p class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__intro-sub">One big hardcover that answers the real questions kids ask, about space, dinosaurs, the human body, the oceans, and a lot more. I left mine on the coffee table and said nothing. My son picked it up on his own and stuck with it longer than any tablet ever has.</p> </div><div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__row"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__image-col"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-3.png" alt="Kids Pick It Up Instead Of The Screen" width="900" height="600"></div> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__text-col"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__text-inner"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__heading-wrap"><span class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__number">1.</span><h3 class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__reason-heading">Kids Pick It Up Instead Of The Screen</h3></div> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__reason-body"><p>The whole point is that they choose it. I did not sit my son down and make him read. I put the book where his tablet usually sits, then walked away. Within a week he was reaching for it on his own.</p><p>It does not feel like homework, so there is no fight over it. When we surveyed buyers, most said their kid started picking it up without being asked inside the first week.</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__row vy-vy-pdp-reasons__row--reverse"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__image-col"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-4.png" alt="One Book Covers Every Subject They Ask About" width="900" height="600"></div> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__text-col"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__text-inner"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__heading-wrap"><span class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__number">2.</span><h3 class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__reason-heading">One Book Covers Every Subject They Ask About</h3></div> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__reason-body"><p>Space, dinosaurs, the human body, oceans, weather, history, animals, science, plants, the brain, technology, and the earth. Twelve subjects sit in one book, so whatever random question lands at dinner, the answer is already on the shelf.</p><p>You are not buying a set of volumes or a subscription. It is a single book that keeps up with a curious kid.</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__row"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__image-col"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-5.png" alt="Written Around The Questions Kids Actually Ask" width="900" height="600"></div> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__text-col"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__text-inner"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__heading-wrap"><span class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__number">3.</span><h3 class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__reason-heading">Written Around The Questions Kids Actually Ask</h3></div> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__reason-body"><p>Why do we have two eyes. Why does the moon not fall out of the sky. These are the questions my kids fire off and then forget I have no clue. The book is built around exactly that kind of question, in plain words a six-year-old can follow.</p><p>It reads like something a curious kid wants, not a textbook a teacher assigned. That is the difference that keeps them turning pages.</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__row vy-vy-pdp-reasons__row--reverse"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__image-col"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-6.png" alt="Built To Be Read For Fun, Ages 6 To 12" width="900" height="600"></div> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__text-col"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__text-inner"> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__heading-wrap"><span class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__number">4.</span><h3 class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__reason-heading">Built To Be Read For Fun, Ages 6 To 12</h3></div> <div class="vy-vy-pdp-reasons__reason-body"><p>Big pictures and short sections, laid out for kids who cannot sit still for long. It is written for ages six to twelve, so it grows with them instead of getting shelved after a month.</p><p>It comes with a 30-day money-back guarantee, so if your kid shrugs at it you get your money back. Mine did not shrug.</p></div> </div> </div> </div></section> </section> <div id="MainQuickSearch" class="vy-vy-quick-search" data-quick-search="" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none !important;"> <div class="vy-vy-quick-search__overlay" data-overlay=""></div> <div class="vy-vy-quick-search__container"> <button type="button" class="vy-vy-quick-search__close" aria-label="Close" data-close-icon=""> <span class="vy-vy-icon-button vy-vy-icon-button-close vy-vy-icon-button--small"> <span class="vy-vy-icon-button__icon"> <span class="vy-vy-icon vy-vy-icon-new vy-vy-icon-close"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2.66 1.34 2 .68.68 2l.66.66 1.32-1.32zm18.68 21.32.66.66L23.32 22l-.66-.66-1.32 1.32zm1.32-20 .66-.66L22 .68l-.66.66 1.32 1.32zM1.34 21.34.68 22 2 23.32l.66-.66-1.32-1.32zm0-18.68 10 10 1.32-1.32-10-10-1.32 1.32zm11.32 10 10-10-1.32-1.32-10 10 1.32 1.32zm-1.32-1.32-10 10 1.32 1.32 10-10-1.32-1.32zm0 1.32 10 10 1.32-1.32-10-10-1.32 1.32z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> </span> </span> </span> </button> <form action="/search" class="vy-vy-quick-search__form" autocomplete="off" data-quick-search-form="" data-scroll-lock-ignore=""> <div class="vy-vy-quick-search__bar"> <div class="vy-vy-quick-search__bar-inner"> <label for="search" class="vy-vy-visually-hidden" aria-label="What are you looking for?"></label> <div class="vy-vy-quick-search__actions"> <button class="vy-vy-qu