20"></div></div></div><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-9" id="c-1666271781000" data-id="1666271781000"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272071137" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272071137"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><font face="Open Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif"><i>Every activity you suggest losing to the tablet before you even finish the sentence...</i></font></p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1666272091834" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1666272091834" data-layout-lg="3+9" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+9" data-layout-sm="3+9" data-layout-xs="3+9"><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-3" id="c-1666271778446" data-id="1666271778446"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272091825" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1666272091825" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf_elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-10.png" alt="" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_image vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyloaded vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload_done" data-gemlang="en" width="512" height="512" data-width="35px" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="512" natural-height="512" data-lg-size="3000x3000" data-lazy-loaded="120"></div></div></div><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-9" id="c-1666271781000" data-id="1666271781000"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272091916" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272091916"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><font face="Open Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif"><i>Homework turning into a standoff because nothing on paper can compete with a screen...</i></font></p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1666272091122" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1666272091122" data-layout-lg="3+9" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+9" data-layout-sm="3+9" data-layout-xs="3+9"><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-3" id="c-1666271778446" data-id="1666271778446"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272091176" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1666272091176" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf_elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-10.png" alt="" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_image vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyloaded vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload_done" data-gemlang="en" width="512" height="512" data-width="35px" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="512" natural-height="512" data-lg-size="3000x3000" data-lazy-loaded="120"></div></div></div><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-9" id="c-1666271781000" data-id="1666271781000"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272091164" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272091164"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><font face="Open Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif"><i>Hearing "I'm bored" the second the screen goes off, like there is nothing else in the world to do...</i></font></p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1666272090520" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1666272090520" data-layout-lg="3+9" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+9" data-layout-sm="3+9" data-layout-xs="3+9"><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-3" id="c-1666271778446" data-id="1666271778446"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272090528" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1666272090528" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf_elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-10.png" alt="" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_image vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyloaded vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload_done" data-gemlang="en" width="512" height="512" data-width="35px" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="512" natural-height="512" data-lg-size="3000x3000" data-lazy-loaded="120"></div></div></div><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-9" id="c-1666271781000" data-id="1666271781000"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272090595" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272090595"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><font face="Open Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif"><i>Family dinners where everyone has a device in hand and nobody is really there...</i></font></p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1646996054160" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1646996054160"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>Now keep your hand up if any of this has made your home feel more disconnected than you ever wanted it to...</p><p><br></p><p>If you are anything like me, you know that quiet ache of watching your kid grow up through a screen and wondering how much of him you are missing.</p><p><br></p><p>And you are probably worn out from fighting about screens every single day and getting nowhere.</p></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666252269391" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1666252269391"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-heading-2">So Why Do Our Kids Choose Screens Over Everything Else?</h1></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1646996054111" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1646996054111" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf_elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-11.jpg" alt="" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_image vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyloaded vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload_done" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1520" height="800" natural-width="1520" natural-height="800" data-lg-size="3000x3000" data-lazy-loaded="1500"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272174843" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272174843"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>We pin it on all kinds of things:</p></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1666272192102" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1666272192102" data-layout-lg="3+9" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+9" data-layout-sm="3+9" data-layout-xs="3+9"><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-3" id="c-1666271778446" data-id="1666271778446"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272191982" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1666272191982" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf_elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-12.png" alt="" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_image vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyloaded vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload_done" data-gemlang="en" width="512" height="512" data-width="35px" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="512" natural-height="512" data-lg-size="3000x3000" data-lazy-loaded="120"></div></div></div><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-9" id="c-1666271781000" data-id="1666271781000"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272191997" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272191997"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><font face="Open Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif"><i>The games and videos are built to keep him hooked, so putting it down feels impossible...</i></font></p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1666272213213" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1666272213213" data-layout-lg="3+9" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+9" data-layout-sm="3+9" data-layout-xs="3+9"><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-3" id="c-1666271778446" data-id="1666271778446"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272213214" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1666272213214" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf_elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-12.png" alt="" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_image vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyloaded vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload_done" data-gemlang="en" width="512" height="512" data-width="35px" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="512" natural-height="512" data-lg-size="3000x3000" data-lazy-loaded="120"></div></div></div><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-9" id="c-1666271781000" data-id="1666271781000"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272213279" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272213279"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><font face="Open Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif"><i>Nothing else in the house is half as interesting, so the tablet wins by default...</i></font></p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1666272212927" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1666272212927" data-layout-lg="3+9" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+9" data-layout-sm="3+9" data-layout-xs="3+9"><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-3 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-3" id="c-1666271778446" data-id="1666271778446"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272212809" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1666272212809" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf_elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-14.png" alt="" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_image vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyloaded vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload_done" data-gemlang="en" width="512" height="512" data-width="35px" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="512" natural-height="512" data-lg-size="3000x3000" data-lazy-loaded="120"></div></div></div><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-9 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-9" id="c-1666271781000" data-id="1666271781000"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272212882" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272212882"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><font face="Open Sans, Helvetica, sans-serif"><i>And the big one, you have run out of ideas that actually pull him away from it...</i></font></p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272295079" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272295079"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>You do not need anyone to tell you the screens have taken over when you cannot remember the last quiet afternoon without one.</p></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1646996054213" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1646996054213"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-heading-2">"So How Do I Actually Get Him Off The Screen?"</h1></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272322260" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1666272322260" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf_elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-15.jpg" alt="" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_image vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyloaded vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload_done" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1520" height="800" natural-width="1520" natural-height="800" data-lg-size="3000x3000" data-lazy-loaded="1500"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272343334" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272343334"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>Fair question. And I will probably annoy a few app makers by saying this...</p><p><br></p><p>But most of the usual tricks we try, the time limits, the bribing, hiding the tablet...</p><p><br></p><p>...just do not stick with a kid who wants the screen back!</p><p><br></p><p>After years of trying, here is what I quietly stopped doing:</p></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1666259505891" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_row vy-vy-vy-gf_row-gap-10" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1666259505891" data-layout-lg="12" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="12" data-layout-sm="12" data-layout-xs="12" data-row-gap="10px" style="display: block; flex-wrap: unset; visibility: visible;"><div class="vy-vy-vy-gf_column vy-vy-vy-gf_col-lg-12 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-md-12 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-sm-12 vy-vy-vy-gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1666256039933" data-id="1666256039933" style="display: block; flex-direction: unset; justify-content: unset; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666259505821" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666259505821"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>❌ <strong>Fighting him head-on about screen time.</strong></p><p>Every rule turned into a standoff. He would dig in, I would raise my voice, and an hour later he was right back on the tablet anyway.</p><p><br></p><p>❌ <strong>Buying more toys and apps that he ignored by day two.</strong></p><p>The new thing held his attention for an afternoon, then joined the pile in the corner while he drifted straight back to YouTube.</p><p><br></p><p>❌<strong>Expecting a lecture to make him curious.</strong></p><p>Telling a nine-year-old that reading is good for him lands about as well as you would guess. He tuned me out every time.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272560685" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272560685"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-heading-2">"If Only There Were One Thing He'd Actually Choose Over The Screen..."</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272580068" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272580068"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>As it turns out, there is.</p><p><br></p><p>Because I finally found something completely different from the toys, the apps, and every screen-free promise I had fallen for before.</p><p><br></p><p>And the part that won over a picky reviewer like me? I did not have to nag him once. He picked it up on his own and stayed with it.</p><p><br></p><p>Now that is a bold claim, and after years of letdowns, trust me, I do not hand out five stars easily.</p><p><br></p><p>Curious whether it actually holds up with a real screen-glued kid? Then please, keep reading.</p></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666258664926" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1666258664926"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-heading-2">INTRODUCING: The 10,000 Whys Kids Encyclopedia</h1></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666258681883" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1666258681883" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf_elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-16.png" alt="" style="width:100% !important;max-width:100% !important;height:auto !important;" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_image vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyloaded vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload_done" data-gemlang="en" data-width="760px" data-height="auto" title="" width="1400" height="737" natural-width="1400" natural-height="737" data-lg-size="3000x3000" data-lazy-loaded="750"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272648241" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272648241"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>Just leave the <a href="https://primenaturals.store/products/kids-encyclopedia-100-000-whys" class=""><strong style="color: rgb(14, 140, 132);">Prime Naturals</strong></a> book out where your kid will spot it. They open it to whatever they were already curious about that day, and a minute later they are a few pages deep in a topic they picked themselves. No nudging from me.</p><p><a href="https://primenaturals.store/products/kids-encyclopedia-100-000-whys" class="" style="color: rgb(14, 140, 132); font-weight: bold;"><br></a></p><p><a href="https://primenaturals.store/products/kids-encyclopedia-100-000-whys" class="" style="color: rgb(14, 140, 132); font-weight: bold;">Prime Naturals</a> built one hardcover that answers the real questions kids ask, and it keeps pulling them back long after the novelty of a new thing usually wears off.</p></div></div><div data-label="Liquid" data-key="liquid" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1666257883037" class="vy-vy-vy-module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-liquid" data-ver="1.1" data-id="1666257883037" data-name="Right click on this, and choose Edit Code."><div class="vy-vy-vy-module vy-vy-vy-gf_module- vy-vy-vy-gf_module--lg vy-vy-vy-gf_module--md vy-vy-vy-gf_module--sm vy-vy-vy-gf_module--xs"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-17.jpg" alt="A child reading the Prime Naturals 10,000 Whys hardcover on the floor at home" width="100%" style="height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:12px;"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272738009" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1666272738009"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-text-edit vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-lg vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>Here is how it works.</p><p><br></p><p>My son opens it to something he was already wondering about, and that is it, he is in. No setup from me, no bribing him to sit still.</p><p><br></p><p>A few days in he started going back to it on his own. He would finish one question, then flip to another, and I would look over and realize the tablet had been sitting there untouched the whole time.</p><p><br></p><p>The part that got me? He kept reaching for it. Not because I asked, but because he actually wanted to know what was on the next page.</p><p><br></p><p>The dinner-table iPad, the "everything is boring" complaints, the fight every single night, all of it started to fade.</p><p><br></p><p>And our evenings at home finally felt like ours again.</p></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1666272766335" class="vy-vy-vy-element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1666272766335" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="vy-vy-vy-elm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center vy-vy-vy-gf_elm-left-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-md vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-sm vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-xs vy-vy-vy-gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-342-prime-naturals/images/img-18.jpg" alt="" class="vy-vy-vy-gf_image vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyloaded vy-vy-vy-gf_lazyload_done" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1520" height="800" natural-width="1520" natural-height="800" data-lg-siz